    "\n",
    "- availability (availability_365)  \n",
    "\n",
    "- demand proxies (number_of_reviews, reviews_per_month)  \n",
    "\n",
    "- estimated revenue  \n",
    "\n",
    "- neighbourhood and geographic coordinates  \n",
    "\n",
    "This reduction simplifies the dataset while preserving all relevant information needed for the analysis."
